{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109195","id":2713135810,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6htyrC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109195","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109195.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109195.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109195","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109195/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109195/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109195/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/716ecf689fbc3b2f542b730465e18b092cab4db9","number":109195,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"RenderingDevice: Fix some image formats in TextureStorage","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes some oddities around the `_validate_texture_format` function in TextureStorage.\r\nSpecifically:\r\n- Removes the `false` while checking for the availability of `FORMAT_RGB8`,\r\n- Changes `DATA_FORMAT_B5G6R5_UNORM_PACK16` to `DATA_FORMAT_R5G6B5_UNORM_PACK16` and removes the swizzle. According to https://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/listlineartilingformats.php this one is more commonly supported,\r\n- Changes the swizzle of `FORMAT_RGBE9995` to RGB1,\r\n- Removes the `XX_RA_AS_RG` formats' sRGB variants. This ensures that both the red and green channels are linear. Additionally, when decompressed, they get converted to RG8 and the swizzle is set properly to account for that.\r\n\r\nThis needs testing, specifically on integrated GPUs, mobile devices (both Mali and Adreno), Apple devices, as well as Direct3D 12.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [ ] Add a testing project.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-01T12:50:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T16:54:11Z","closed_at":"2026-08-29T16:54:01Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"BlueCube3310:rd-tex-cleanup","ref":"rd-tex-cleanup","repo":{"id":672274783,"node_id":"R_kgDOKBIZXw","name":"godot","full_name":"BlueCube3310/godot","owner